  <prompt>
    Build shared lib + WorkspaceLayoutWizard + LegalWorkspace + SpaarkeAi. Deploy to spaarkedev1. Regression-test wizard authoring flow (rowHeight, SectionInstance, widthPreference) + back-compat on 8+ existing published layouts. Commit + push + open PR 2 with 3 FRs (FR-02, FR-03, FR-04).
  </prompt>

  <role>
    SPAARKE deployment operator + wizard regression tester.
  </role>

  <goal>
    PR 2 open with 3 FRs from Phase 2. All 4 code pages deployed. Regression clean: wizard produces valid JSON for all new fields; 8+ existing bare-string layouts continue to render.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      Phase 2 delivers wizard UI enhancements + per-instance overrides. Ships in a single PR (PR 2) after Phase 1's framework foundations are merged.
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>scripts/Build-AllClientComponents.ps1</file>
      <file>scripts/Deploy-AllDataGridConsumers.ps1</file>
      <file>.claude/skills/code-page-deploy/SKILL.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">MUST verify both LegalWorkspace + SpaarkeAi rebuilds (dual-deploy trap still exists until FR-10 in PR 3).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Regression on wizard: (a) rowHeight dropdown works, (b) SectionInstance Advanced panel produces valid JSON, (c) widthPreference placement modal fires on multi-slot drop of full-width widget.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Regression on runtime: 8+ existing bare-string published layouts continue to render identically to pre-R2.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>projects/spaarke-dataset-grid-framework-r2/CLAUDE.md</file>
      <file>projects/spaarke-dataset-grid-framework-r2/spec.md</file>
      <file>projects/spaarke-dataset-grid-framework-r2/plan.md</file>
