  </knowledge>

  <steps>
    <step order="1">Confirm tasks 010-015 all ✅. `git status` clean expected changes.</step>
    <step order="2">Build via `scripts/Build-AllClientComponents.ps1` + `scripts/Build-ViteSolutionsDirect.ps1`.</step>
    <step order="3">Deploy via `/code-page-deploy` — WorkspaceLayoutWizard + LegalWorkspace + SpaarkeAi (shared lib rebuild reaches both consumers).</step>
    <step order="4">Regression wizard flow — author a test layout in WorkspaceLayoutWizard: set `rowHeight: '80vh'` on a row, place Documents section with `configIdOverride` + `label: 'Documents (alt)'` in Advanced, save. Inspect resulting JSON: contains `rowHeight` on row and `SectionInstance` object with overrides.</step>
    <step order="5">Regression widthPreference — attempt to place Communications (full-width) in a `1fr 1fr` row → modal appears. Click "Cancel" to keep row → wizard warns via icon. Force placement anyway (via JSON edit or "keep row" path) → publish layout → open in LegalWorkspace → DevTools console shows `console.warn` about widthPreference violation (dev mode).</step>
    <step order="6">Regression back-compat — open 3-5 existing published `sprk_workspacelayout` records with bare-string sections. Verify they still render identically. No console errors.</step>
    <step order="7">Regression on SpaarkeAi — confirm SpaarkeAi renders identically to LegalWorkspace for the same layouts.</step>
    <step order="8">Invoke `/push-to-github`. Commit: `feat(datagrid-framework): PR 2 — wizard UI + per-instance overrides (FR-02, FR-03, FR-04)`. Push to `origin/work/spaarke-dataset-grid-framework-r2`.</step>
    <step order="9">Open PR 2 with body citing FRs 02/03/04 + acceptance evidence.</step>
    <step order="10">Wait for CI. Fix any failures.</step>
    <step order="11">Update TASK-INDEX.md: 016 → ✅.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="powershell">Build scripts</tool>
    <tool name="Skill">code-page-deploy, push-to-github</tool>
    <tool name="gh">Open PR</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="deploy">3 code pages deployed to spaarkedev1</output>
    <output type="pr">GitHub PR (PR 2) opened</output>
    <output type="report">notes/phase2-regression-report.md</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">All builds succeed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Wizard authoring flow produces valid JSON for all new fields.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Full-width placement modal fires on multi-slot drop.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Runtime dev-guard fires in dev mode.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">8+ existing bare-string layouts continue to render.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">SpaarkeAi renders identically to LegalWorkspace.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">PR 2 open, CI green.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    - Phase 2 is a larger PR than Phase 1 (more code in wizard). May want to add screenshots/video to PR description for visual UX changes.
    - PR 3 (FR-10 extraction + FR-09 docs) is the last piece. After PR 2 merges, coordinate merge order with `spaarkeai-compose-r1` before starting Phase 3.
